{"parse": {"title": "3RD-02", "pageid": 6066, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-01\" title=\"3RD-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">3RD-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-03\" title=\"3RD-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">3RD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.9D.92.E8.9B.99.E4.B8.8E.E5.A4.AA.E5.A6.83\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"青蛙与太妃\">青蛙与太妃</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 青蛙与太妃</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Frog and Toffee</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-left: 16px; margin-bottom: -5px;\"><span class=\"item-link mode-middle mode-bonus\" data-itemid=\"1/120011\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><div class=\"item-bonus-probability star-5\"><span>首通</span></div><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%80%E7%9E%AC%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%81%E5%8A%A8\" title=\"一瞬的躁动\"><img alt=\"Bgequip3.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/100px-Bgequip3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/150px-Bgequip3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Bgequip3.png/200px-Bgequip3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%80%E7%9E%AC%E7%9A%84%E8%BA%81%E5%8A%A8\" title=\"一瞬的躁动\"><img alt=\"一瞬的躁动\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Item-120011.png/100px-Item-120011.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Item-120011.png/150px-Item-120011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/Item-120011.png/200px-Item-120011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a></span><div class=\"item-middle-count\">5</div></span></span><span>&#8204;</span></span></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>鹅<span class=\"color-value\"></span>卵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>石<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>青<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蛙<span class=\"color-value\"></span>、<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>楼<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>臭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>袜<span class=\"color-value\"></span>子<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>它<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>世<span class=\"color-value\"></span>界<span class=\"color-value\"></span>中<span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>部<span class=\"color-value\"></span>分<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10302</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_weiertingfazhan1\"><img alt=\"at_weiertingfazhan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png/600px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png/900px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png/1200px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后一堂课结束了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>学生三两成群地从教室离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>教员再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……还是换另一条路走吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>过来过来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_weiertingfazhan2\"><img alt=\"at_weiertingfazhan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png/600px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png/900px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png/1200px-Cg-at_weiertingfazhan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我的书墙还在吗？教员没有推倒它吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>呼……她真是个好人。魔药教员就坏极了，把书墙变成了一滩污泥……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>对了。你猜猜我今天找到了什么好东西？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>来，把手给我。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_errenwoshou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_errenwoshou\"><img alt=\"at_errenwoshou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-at_errenwoshou.png/600px-Cg-at_errenwoshou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-at_errenwoshou.png/900px-Cg-at_errenwoshou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-at_errenwoshou.png/1200px-Cg-at_errenwoshou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>看，能预告雨季到来的——欧洲树蛙！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我在校门外抓到的，手缩回来时还被电网刺了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>它一直在口袋里叫个不停，你看，外面现在还在下着雨呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你知道你在罚站吗？维尔汀小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaozoulang\"><img alt=\"xuexiaozoulang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c8/Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaozoulang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我不明白……你为什么老是不来上课。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你是知道的，我们不应该过多的关注学校以外的事务。所以……请不要再把这些鹅卵石、小青蛙塞给我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这些……都是没有意义的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>——我们生来就是要去赴死的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……为什么？就因为《第一防线学生守则》是这么写的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我不喜欢《学生守则》，它闻起来就像阁楼上的臭袜子一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>十四行诗，你对外界的事情真的一点也不好奇吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你明明也参加过校外的巡礼表演……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>鹅卵石、小青蛙、阁楼上的臭袜子，只是世界的很小很小的一部分。我以前还见过一个来我们学校的女孩——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>请、请不要再说下去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>这些东西很危险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/94/HeadIconSmall-506401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>《学生守则》在保护我们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>保护我们远离伤害和遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>教员说过，人生只会在不停地失去中走向死亡。因此我们都应该把精力放在最高使命上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>——在不停地失去中……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>走向死亡？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-507601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8d/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjianheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-506701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-506701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-506701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>啧，失败了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\"><img alt=\"kangfuzhongxinfangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/600px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/900px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e9/Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png/1200px-Cg-kangfuzhongxinfangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>创伤片段又被激活了。功率调大，稳住心相。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>换下一个梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>她不一定适合人工梦游疗法，小梅斯梅尔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>嗯？你来了，Z女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>所有出现应激障碍的患者都需要康复中心的治疗。她的创伤等级被评估为Ⅱ型，我需要为她的健康负责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>她成为司辰的那年……并没有接受任何治疗。我了解她。她自身有足够的力量。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我只是奉命行事，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>治疗维尔汀是你们委员会亲自下达的指令。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"305701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"305701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/cd/HeadIconSmall-305701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-305701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>等你说服了副会长，再来找我谈吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>她几天没进食了，给她补充点葡萄糖。稍后还有一个会议，先失陪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>Z女士捎上随身的保温杯，走出了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>病房又变得安静了。除了幽微的电流声，几乎听不见其他的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我曾指望这漫长的时光能让你学到点什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>司辰……不，我还是更习惯称呼你为维尔汀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>我早已变了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小梅斯梅尔：</div><div>你呢？还在为那些多余而无意义的事情……受罪吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她摇摇头，视线移到显示屏上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>心相振幅正机械地跃动着，没有任何回应。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "3RD-02"}}